# LaLyli — Creative Workshops for Kids

Responsive landing page for LaLyli, a creative workshop center for children based in Iași, Romania.

This project was built as a frontend practice exercise, focusing on a warm visual experience, simple navigation, and quick workshop registration.

## Demo

🔗 **Live Preview:** [narcis734.github.io/Atelier-LaLyli/](https://narcis734.github.io/Atelier-LaLyli/)

## Features

- **Responsive Layout:** Optimized for desktop, tablet, and mobile devices (includes a dedicated mobile menu).
- **Workshop Catalog:** Showcases 9 creative workshops with recommended age groups and pricing.
- **Interactive Photo Gallery:** Lightbox modal with next/previous navigation and keyboard support.
- **Dynamic Registration Form:**
  - Support for registering single or multiple children.
  - Workshop selection filtered by the child's age.
  - Preferred date and time selection.
  - Basic HTML form validation and post-submission confirmation message.
- **UX & Accessibility:**
  - Smooth scrolling navigation.
  - "Back to Top" button.
  - Scroll-triggered animations via Intersection Observer API.
  - Accessibility features (`alt` tags, `aria-label`, `aria-expanded`, skip link).

## Tech Stack

- Semantic HTML5
- CSS3 (Flexbox & CSS Grid)
- Vanilla JavaScript
- Intersection Observer API
- Google Fonts
- FormSubmit (for handling form submissions)

